# Real receipts used for testing OCR. Financial records — never committed,
# and the repo is on GitHub.
#
# ANCHORED to the repo root. Unanchored, this matched any directory named
# `receipts` at any depth, and silently swallowed the app/money/receipts route
# — `git add` refused it and the feature would have shipped with its page
# missing. The rule is about a folder of real financial documents at the top
# level, so that is what it says now.
/receipts/

